{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/898910/extras/32407e21369d3e6e288247c05bf1a466.avif?t=1758388036\" width=600 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DASH: Danger Action Speed Heroes \u2013 CREATE. RUN. COMPETE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity and speed! Build insane levels filled with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed streaks &amp; precision challenges</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies, platforms, crates &amp; spikes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind-bending puzzles &amp; action-packed arenas</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your world, your rules:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design <strong>puzzle, runner, extreme precision, or any genre</strong> levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore tilesets and backgrounds to craft your story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go <strong>horizontal or vertical</strong>\u2014the choice is yours</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/898910/extras/c29536ba81fa53f44b15fa28f209c500.poster.avif?t=1758388036\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/898910/extras/c29536ba81fa53f44b15fa28f209c500.webm?t=1758388036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/898910/extras/c29536ba81fa53f44b15fa28f209c500.mp4?t=1758388036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play, share, compete:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills with <strong>gamepad or keyboard</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload <strong>unlimited levels</strong> for the world to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your arenas become <strong>hot spots for speedrunners</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The DASH World Challenge:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for <strong>shiny, colorful diamonds</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through levels to prove your status as a runner</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track plays to see your worth as a creator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the <strong>fastest &amp; smartest</strong> will rise to the top</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/898910/extras/32979bd9fb5fc563fd54ca0f6e66c699.poster.avif?t=1758388036\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/898910/extras/32979bd9fb5fc563fd54ca0f6e66c699.webp?t=1758388036\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=164 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global competition:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels from <strong>easy to \u201chow is this even possible?\u201d</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Worldwide leaderboards</strong>: world records, completed levels, and creators with the most plays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a <strong>live community</strong> on Discord\u2014speedrunners, streamers, and level creators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create <strong>playlists</strong>, share them, and stay engaged with <strong>daily dynamic levels</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Show off your skills. Share your worlds